    (wcZModSheaf (Over.mk (W.ι ≫ X.hom)).left (ℓ ^ k)) ρ (Nat.card K ^ 1) hρi hρs hρF
  obtain ⟨Θ1, hΘ1b, hΘ1F⟩ := wc_lfi_coker_scaled_transport (Over.mk (W.ι ≫ X.hom)).left
